    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "Dualformer uses a training framework that utilizes randomized reasoning traces. The approach involves randomizing the reasoning trace by dropping certain parts of it for each training example. There are four levels of dropping strategies, each building upon the previous one. This training framework enables Dualformer to learn from multiple reduced traces even for a single training example.",
