    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "Dualformer achieves state-of-the-art performance in both fast and slow modes, while also generating more diverse plans and shorter reasoning traces. In the slow mode, Dualformer achieves a 97.6% optimal rate on unseen 30 \u00d7 30 maze tasks, surpassing the Searchformer baseline. In the fast mode, Dualformer achieves an 80% optimal rate, significantly outperforming the Solution-Only model.",
